{"id":"selbstmord","lemma":"Selbstmord","pos":"noun","rank":1428,"glosses":["suicide"],"ipa":"/ˈzɛlps(t)ˌmɔʁt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/De-Selbstmord.ogg/De-Selbstmord.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Selbstmordes","plural":"Selbstmorde"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich glaube, es war Selbstmord.","en":"I believe it was suicide.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ich denke, dass Selbstmord falsch ist.","en":"I believe that suicide is wrong.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"false"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Die Polizei geht von Selbstmord aus.","en":"The police think it's a suicide.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"police"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"from / of"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Das wäre reiner Selbstmord.","en":"That would be suicidal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758812","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"inside, in here","l":"rein"},null]},{"text":"Ich würde nie Selbstmord begehen.","en":"I'd never commit suicide.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"dignity"},{"g":"never, never at all"},null,{"g":"to commit, perpetrate"}]}]}